      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LEGENDA DE CORES\n🔵 Fontes / Sinais / Exporters    🟢 Receivers    🟣 Pipeline\n🟠 Processors (a engenharia)    🩷 Connectors    🟩 Backends\n─── fluxo do dado     ····· contexto transversal (vale p/ tudo)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "legend-box",
      "originalText": "LEGENDA DE CORES\n🔵 Fontes / Sinais / Exporters    🟢 Receivers    🟣 Pipeline\n🟠 Processors (a engenharia)    🩷 Connectors    🟩 Backends\n─── fluxo do dado     ····· contexto transversal (vale p/ tudo)",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },

