      "text": "1 · 🌐 TELEMETRY SOURCES\n\nApps / SDKs / Auto-instrumentation\nKubernetes / VMs / Hosts\nPrometheus / Logs / Kafka / DB\n\n💡 \"O dado nasce aqui. O Collector\nainda nem entrou em cena.\"",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "n01",
      "originalText": "1 · 🌐 TELEMETRY SOURCES\n\nApps / SDKs / Auto-instrumentation\nKubernetes / VMs / Hosts\nPrometheus / Logs / Kafka / DB\n\n💡 \"O dado nasce aqui. O Collector\nainda nem entrou em cena.\"",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
