      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3 · 🟢 RECEIVERS (a porta de entrada)\n\nOTLP (gRPC/HTTP) — stable nos 3 sinais\nPrometheus · Jaeger · Zipkin · Kafka\nFilelog · Syslog · Journald · Hostmetrics\n\n💡 \"Recebe, escuta porta, faz scrape,\nlê arquivo, consome fila.\"",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "n03",
      "originalText": "3 · 🟢 RECEIVERS (a porta de entrada)\n\nOTLP (gRPC/HTTP) — stable nos 3 sinais\nPrometheus · Jaeger · Zipkin · Kafka\nFilelog · Syslog · Journald · Hostmetrics\n\n💡 \"Recebe, escuta porta, faz scrape,\nlê arquivo, consome fila.\"",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
