      "text": "4 · ☸️ RECEIVERS KUBERNETES\n\nkubeletstats · k8s_cluster\nk8sobjects · k8sevents · filelog\nNodes/Pods/Containers/Deployments\n\n💡 \"No K8s o Collector roda como\nDaemonSet (agent) + Deployment (gw).\"",
      "fontSize": 14,
