      "text": "7 · 🟠 PROCESSORS: ENRIQUECIMENTO\n\nattributes (insert/update/hash/delete)\nresource (service.name, cloud, k8s)\nk8sattributes (metadata do Pod: ns/pod/node)\nresourcedetection (AWS/GCP/Azure/host)\n\n💡 \"service.name é o atributo mais\nimportante de toda a telemetria.\"",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "n07",
      "originalText": "7 · 🟠 PROCESSORS: ENRIQUECIMENTO\n\nattributes (insert/update/hash/delete)\nresource (service.name, cloud, k8s)\nk8sattributes (metadata do Pod: ns/pod/node)\nresourcedetection (AWS/GCP/Azure/host)\n\n💡 \"service.name é o atributo mais\nimportante de toda a telemetria.\"",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },

