      "boundElements": [],
      "updatedAt": 1756600000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "10 · 🎯 SAMPLING\n\nhead / probabilistic: decide no início\n(100k → 10k, barato mas cego)\ntail_sampling: espera a trace inteira →\nERROR / latency>2s / service=payment → KEEP\n\n💡 \"Tail sampling corta custo SEM\nperder o trace que importa.\"",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "n10",
      "originalText": "10 · 🎯 SAMPLING\n\nhead / probabilistic: decide no início\n(100k → 10k, barato mas cego)\ntail_sampling: espera a trace inteira →\nERROR / latency>2s / service=payment → KEEP\n\n💡 \"Tail sampling corta custo SEM\nperder o trace que importa.\"",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },

