      "text": "11 · 📊 GROUP BY + MÉTRICAS\n\ngroupbytrace (junta spans da mesma trace)\ngroupbyattrs (tenant/service/region)\nmetricstransform: cumulative ↔ delta,\ndelta → rate, geração de métricas\n\n💡 \"groupbytrace costuma vir ANTES\ndo tail_sampling.\"",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "n11",
      "originalText": "11 · 📊 GROUP BY + MÉTRICAS\n\ngroupbytrace (junta spans da mesma trace)\ngroupbyattrs (tenant/service/region)\nmetricstransform: cumulative ↔ delta,\ndelta → rate, geração de métricas\n\n💡 \"groupbytrace costuma vir ANTES\ndo tail_sampling.\"",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
