      "text": "14 · 🩷 CONNECTORS ATUAIS\n\nGERAÇÃO: spanmetrics · servicegraph · count\nsum · signaltometrics · exceptions\nROUTING: routing (decide destino)\nRESILIÊNCIA: failover · DISTRIB: round_robin/forward\n\n💡 \"spanmetrics = RED metrics de graça\na partir dos seus traces.\"",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "n14",
      "originalText": "14 · 🩷 CONNECTORS ATUAIS\n\nGERAÇÃO: spanmetrics · servicegraph · count\nsum · signaltometrics · exceptions\nROUTING: routing (decide destino)\nRESILIÊNCIA: failover · DISTRIB: round_robin/forward\n\n💡 \"spanmetrics = RED metrics de graça\na partir dos seus traces.\"",
