      "text": "16 · 🟩 OBSERVABILITY BACKENDS\n\nTraces → Tempo/Jaeger\nMetrics → Prometheus/Mimir\nLogs → Loki  ·  Tudo → Grafana\nDatadog · Splunk · OpenSearch · Elastic\n\n💡 \"OTel é vendor-agnostic: troca de\nbackend = troca de exporter.\"",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "n16",
      "originalText": "16 · 🟩 OBSERVABILITY BACKENDS\n\nTraces → Tempo/Jaeger\nMetrics → Prometheus/Mimir\nLogs → Loki  ·  Tudo → Grafana\nDatadog · Splunk · OpenSearch · Elastic\n\n💡 \"OTel é vendor-agnostic: troca de\nbackend = troca de exporter.\"",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
