      "locked": false,
      "text": "17 · 🧩 EXTENSIONS (fora da pipeline)\n\nhealth_check (liveness/readiness p/ K8s)\npprof (CPU/mem/heap) · zpages (debug interno)\nfile_storage (persistência da sending_queue)\nAuth: basic/bearer/oauth2/sigv4\n\n💡 \"Não tocam no dado; dão superpoderes\nao Collector (obs., auth, storage).\"",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "n17",
      "originalText": "17 · 🧩 EXTENSIONS (fora da pipeline)\n\nhealth_check (liveness/readiness p/ K8s)\npprof (CPU/mem/heap) · zpages (debug interno)\nfile_storage (persistência da sending_queue)\nAuth: basic/bearer/oauth2/sigv4\n\n💡 \"Não tocam no dado; dão superpoderes\nao Collector (obs., auth, storage).\"",
