      "updatedAt": 1756600000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 FUNDAMENTOS (OTLP · Traces · Metrics · Logs · Resources · Attributes · Semantic Conventions)  →  2 COLLECTOR (Receiver · Pipeline · Processor · Exporter)  →  3 PROCESSAMENTO (attributes · resource · k8sattributes · resourcedetection · transform/OTTL · filter · redaction · batch · memory_limiter)  →  4 SAMPLING (probabilistic · tail_sampling · groupbytrace)  →  5 CONNECTORS (spanmetrics · servicegraph · routing · count · sum · failover)\n\n6 KUBERNETES (kubeletstats · k8scluster · k8sobjects · k8sevents · filelog · k8sattributes)  →  7 RESILIÊNCIA (sending_queue · retry_on_failure · file_storage · memory_limiter · failover)  →  8 SEGURANÇA (TLS · mTLS · Auth · Authorization · Redaction · Secrets)  →  9 PERFORMANCE (CPU · Memory · Throughput · Batch · Queue · Concurrency · Cardinality · Backpressure)  →  10 ARQUITETURA (Agent → Gateway → Routing → Processing → Backend)\n\n🎤 FECHAMENTO: \"O Collector não é um proxy de OTLP. É onde você faz engenharia de observabilidade: enriquece, filtra, protege PII, controla custo e deriva sinais — antes do dado tocar o backend.\"",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "trilha-box",
      "originalText": "1 FUNDAMENTOS (OTLP · Traces · Metrics · Logs · Resources · Attributes · Semantic Conventions)  →  2 COLLECTOR (Receiver · Pipeline · Processor · Exporter)  →  3 PROCESSAMENTO (attributes · resource · k8sattributes · resourcedetection · transform/OTTL · filter · redaction · batch · memory_limiter)  →  4 SAMPLING (probabilistic · tail_sampling · groupbytrace)  →  5 CONNECTORS (spanmetrics · servicegraph · routing · count · sum · failover)\n\n6 KUBERNETES (kubeletstats · k8scluster · k8sobjects · k8sevents · filelog · k8sattributes)  →  7 RESILIÊNCIA (sending_queue · retry_on_failure · file_storage · memory_limiter · failover)  →  8 SEGURANÇA (TLS · mTLS · Auth · Authorization · Redaction · Secrets)  →  9 PERFORMANCE (CPU · Memory · Throughput · Batch · Queue · Concurrency · Cardinality · Backpressure)  →  10 ARQUITETURA (Agent → Gateway → Routing → Processing → Backend)\n\n🎤 FECHAMENTO: \"O Collector não é um proxy de OTLP. É onde você faz engenharia de observabilidade: enriquece, filtra, protege PII, controla custo e deriva sinais — antes do dado tocar o backend.\"",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    }
